            "sourceId": "12ff9062-ee9a-5e36-9979-f6506a832ca4",
            "quote": "The word 'tikuli' is the local term for 'bindi', which is usually a bright, colorful dot that women wear between their brows.",
            "locator": "p. 5",
            "context": null,
            "evidence": "QUOTED",
            "level": "PROVISIONAL"
          },
          {
            "id": "912423ab-be9d-5fc4-8f4c-745afbe0f2f5",
