            "sourceId": "44b8bf79-a233-5e5d-ba0d-b2c5da2d2ba0",
            "quote": "Modern Tikuli practice shifts from glass to hardboard or medium-density fibreboard and uses enamel paints that produce a glossy, durable surface.",
